  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harnessing synergies between Climate Change Adaptation and Risk Reduction in Migrant-Inclusive Health System Responses</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The joint programme aims to contribute to strengthening synergies between Climate Change Adaptation and risk reduction in the Middle East and North Africa region through mainstreaming a gender-sensitive human mobility lens into national public health adaptation and Disaster Risk Reduction strategies. IOM, WHO and UNDRR will join forces to address the interlinkages of climate change, risk reduction, health and human mobility and design replicable models.</narrative>
  </description>
